# Docker 构建忽略文件
# 防止将本地开发文件、敏感配置、依赖缓存打包进镜像

# === Git ===
.git
.gitattributes
.gitignore
.github

# === IDE / 编辑器 ===
.vs
.vscode
.idea
*.suo
*.user
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates

# === 后端 ===
**/bin
**/obj
backend/Properties/launchSettings.json
backend/appsettings.Development.json

# === 前端 ===
**/node_modules
frontend/.env
frontend/.env.local
frontend/.env.development

# === 数据库 ===
database/verify           # 校验脚本不需要打包
database/README.md

# === 部署 ===
deploy/**/.env            # 敏感配置！必须排除
deploy/**/.env.local
deploy/oracle/*.env
deploy/docker/*.env

# === 文档 ===
docs
*.md
!README.md

# === 模板（历史留档，不参与构建）===
template
template-backend
template-frontend
template-demo-guide

# === 测试 ===
**/tests
**/*.Tests

# === 构建产物（已通过 artifact 传入）===
publish
**/dist
**/coverage

# === 上传文件（运行时数据）===
uploads
**/uploads/*

# === OS ===
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
